%N A013622 Triangle of coefficients in expansion of (3+5*x)^n.
%H A013622 Vincenzo Librandi, <a href="/A013622/b013622.txt">Rows n = 0..100, flattened</a>
%H A013622 Gábor Kallós, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5802/ambp.211">A generalization of Pascal’s triangle using powers of base numbers</a>, Annales mathématiques Blaise Pascal, 13 no. 1 (2006), p. 1-15.
%F A013622 G.f.: 1 / (1 - x*(3+5*y)).
%F A013622 T(n,k) = 5*T(n-1,k-1) + 3*T(n-1,k) with T(0,0)=1, T(n,k)=0 for k<0 or k>n. - _Ranjan Kumar Dhani_, Aug 23 2026
